From: Marek Vasut <marek.vasut@gmail.com>
Subject: ASIX: Add AX88772B USB ID

Upstream Linux commit 308859097831831a979f2e82cbeef0a94f438080
("ASIX: Add AX88772B USB ID", Linux 3.1), by Marek Vasut, with
"Signed-off-by: Marek Vasut <marek.vasut@gmail.com>" and
"Signed-off-by: David S. Miller <davem@davemloft.net>".

Adapted to Linux 2.6.31 for Melodious: the same 0b95:772b entry with
ax88772_info, placed at the end of 2.6.31's table instead of before the
AX88772 entry, with a longer comment.

--- a/drivers/net/usb/asix.c
+++ b/drivers/net/usb/asix.c
@@ -1492,6 +1492,10 @@
 	// ASIX 88772a
 	USB_DEVICE(0x0db0, 0xa877),
 	.driver_info = (unsigned long) &ax88772_info,
+}, {
+	// ASIX AX88772B 10/100 (added upstream in Linux 3.1 the same way)
+	USB_DEVICE (0x0b95, 0x772b),
+	.driver_info = (unsigned long) &ax88772_info,
 },
 	{ },		// END
 };
